# Local Obsidian vault (ADR 0002 §18). The vault is a SEPARATE Git repository:
# agent- and human-authored knowledge must not land in application commits, and
# application history must not clutter knowledge diffs. Leading slash so only
# the vault directory at the repo root is ignored -- src/nexus/obsidian/, the
# ADR, and tests/test_obsidian_vault.py are all unaffected.
/NVLabsCompany/
# Any vault a developer keeps inside the working tree by convention.
/vaults/
.obsidian/

graphify-out/


